This distribution is rouge 1.0.1 with these changes:
- rouge/rouge.py: whitespace-only segments between periods are dropped when splitting texts
  into sentences, instead of becoming an empty "" token (texts made only of whitespace and
  periods are handled exactly as in 1.0.1).
- rouge/rouge_score.py: upstream commit 4b57032 (PR #69 by Lppy, merged on upstream master
  but never released) replaces the recursive LCS reconstruction with a loop.
- rouge/__init__.py: __version__ = "1.0.2".
- Packaging: pyproject.toml replaces setup.py; distribution name fitzyracing-rouge;
  import name unchanged.
- Tests: tests/test_fork_fixes.py; README, CHANGELOG and this NOTICE.
